                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game of my childhood. Very good one. I love it so much. Nice game for kids and adults. Makes your brain really strain. It has more content than first game, everything is better. Music, visual and of course the levels. Crazy Machines 1.5 contains two games: Crazy Machines 1.5 New from the Lab and Crazy Machines 1.5 Inventors Training Camp. Both are good and you should play it. I recommend it for everyone. Playing this game with whole family makes awesome atmosphere.\n\n10/10",
